cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this code or these run records, please cite the article (once published) and this
  reproducibility package.
type: software
title: >-
  Reproducibility package for "Baseline Configuration and Random-Sampling Controls in Metaheuristic
  Comparisons for Wind Farm Layout Optimization"
version: 1.0.0-rc
date-released: "2026-10-04"
authors:
  - family-names: Solanki
    given-names: Prince
    email: prince@iilm.edu
    affiliation: "Department of Mathematics, School of Computer Science & Engineering, IILM University, Gurugram, Haryana, India"
  - family-names: Dwivedi
    given-names: Pulkit
    affiliation: "Department of Computer Science and Engineering, Bennett University, Greater Noida, Uttar Pradesh, India"
  - family-names: Garg
    given-names: Vanita
    affiliation: "Amity University, Noida, Uttar Pradesh, India"
  - family-names: Shukla
    given-names: Vinay
    affiliation: "School of Mathematical Sciences, Shanghai Jiao Tong University, Shanghai, China; Department of Mathematics, School of Computer Science Engineering and Technology, Bennett University, Greater Noida, Uttar Pradesh, India"
contact:
  - family-names: Solanki
    given-names: Prince
    email: prince@iilm.edu
abstract: >-
  Code (benchmark, Horns Rev 1, IEA37 and Lillgrund evaluators; PSO, PSO-VNS, SSA, LX-SSA, DE, GA, VNS,
  SSA-VNS, LX-SSA-VNS, RS-VNS, RSD-VNS, MS-SLSQP and exact-gradient variants; experiment drivers; analysis
  and check scripts), all per-run records of the study (36,190 original, 11,640 revision-2 and the
  revision-3 records) and the generated tables, figures and number macros of the article and its supplement.
keywords:
  - wind farm layout optimization
  - metaheuristics
  - benchmarking
  - particle swarm optimization
  - variable neighborhood search
  - reproducibility
